28:53.231 --> 28:54.482
Sial!

28:55.066 --> 28:57.026
Lepaskan kemudinya!

28:57.610 --> 28:58.445
Sial!

29:00.488 --> 29:02.073
Hentikan!

29:20.925 --> 29:24.721
